stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Review: open /checkout
    Review --> Submitting: Place order (server creates Idempotency-Key)
    Submitting --> Confirmed: 201, status CONFIRMED
    Submitting --> Pending: 201, status PENDING
    Submitting --> OutOfStock: 409 OUT_OF_STOCK
    Submitting --> Declined: 402 PAYMENT_DECLINED
    Submitting --> Retry: timeout or 5xx
    Retry --> Submitting: same Idempotency-Key
    Pending --> Confirmed: poll GET /orders/{id}
    Pending --> Cancelled: poll shows CANCELLED
    OutOfStock --> Review: cart refreshed, lines marked
    Declined --> Review: choose another card
    Confirmed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
